    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE Auctioneers is delighted to present this magnificent home to the market. 53 Cherrywood Grove offers an ideal balance of living and bedroom accommodation. This impressive semi-detached family home was constructed circa 1980 and is discreetly nestled in one of the best locations in Clondalkin, in a quiet and mature neighborhood that is highly sought after by families. The accommodation includes a bright entrance hall, a spacious living room and a bright kitchen and dining area that opens up to a private southwest-facing rear garden. There are also three well-lit bedrooms and a family bathroom. At the back of the property, you’ll find a low-maintenance garden that is perfect for relaxation or outdoor activities. The home is ideally situated close to Clondalkin Village, which is within walking distance, providing access to local amenities including shops, schools, leisure facilities, hotels, bars, and restaurants. Public transport links are nearby, and the Luas Red Cow station, as well as the M50 and N7 motorways, are easily accessible, connecting you to all parts of the county. \r\n\r\nContact Shauna O’Brien to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway\t\t3.43m x 1.36m \t\tBright entrance hall to include tiled flooring, and ample storage.  \r\n\t\r\nLounge\t\t\t       4.67m x 3.34m\t\t        Large lounge area to include feature fireplace, wood flooring and T.V point. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room      5.05m x 2.97m\t\t       Shaker style floor and eye level units, tiled flooring. PVC door opening onto a private south west facing garden.  \r\n\r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t\t3.72m x 2.69m\t      To include wood flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t3.30m x 3.13m\t\tTo include wood flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\n(3) Bedroom\t\t\t2.46m x 2.57m \t\tTo include wood flooring.\r\n\t\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.22m x 1.89m\t        Fully tiled bathroom to include W.H.B, W.C and Triton T90 sr shower. \r\n\r\nGarden\t\t\t       9.96m x 7.75m\t\t       Low maintenance south west facing rear garden.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
